{"id":"n36964-1-7","stage":5,"title":"구내식당 · 食堂","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n36964-1-7-1","ko":"오늘 구내식당 메뉴는 카레라이스래요.","zh":"今天食堂的菜单是咖喱饭啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"구내식당","meaning":"食堂","explanation":"구내식당：食堂。","readings":[{"term":"구내식당","audio":"/audio/5ef95b18c670906a015d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36964","senseId":"1","lemma":"구내식당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구내식당","audio":"/audio/5ef95b18c670906a015d.mp3"}},{"text":"메뉴는","meaning":"菜品","explanation":"메뉴：菜品；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"메뉴","audio":"/audio/13b36d6d0ccc7f4960aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57299","senseId":"2","lemma":"메뉴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"메뉴는","audio":"/audio/4e6c656bb4456366eb0a.mp3"}},{"text":"카레라이스래요.","meaning":"咖喱饭","explanation":"카레라이스：咖喱饭；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；래요：口语中礼貌地转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"카레라이스","audio":"/audio/d2fd68fd5ccebd522d19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80960","senseId":"1","lemma":"카레라이스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"카레라이스래요","audio":"/audio/163faa9d554fc3609542.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"5ef95b18c670906a","term":"구내식당","zh":"食堂","audio":"/audio/5ef95b18c670906a015d.mp3","entryId":"36964","definition":"在公司、医院、车站等大建筑物或设施内的餐厅。","pronunciation":["구내식땅"]},{"id":"13b36d6d0ccc7f49","term":"메뉴","zh":"菜品","audio":"/audio/13b36d6d0ccc7f4960aa.mp3","entryId":"57299","definition":"料理的种类。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"d2fd68fd5ccebd52","term":"카레라이스","zh":"咖喱饭","audio":"/audio/d2fd68fd5ccebd522d19.mp3","entryId":"80960","definition":"一种先将切成大块的肉和土豆、洋葱等蔬菜炒熟后，加入咖喱粉煮，最后倒入饭中吃的印度料理。","pronunciation":[]}],"audio":"/audio/69ff12ebba264bbe20f6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n36964-1-7-2","ko":"지난 주에도 나왔던 메뉴군요. 그럼 오늘은 밖에 나가서 먹을까요?","zh":"这菜单上周也出过呢。那今天咱们出去吃吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지난","meaning":"过， 度过","explanation":"지나다：过， 度过；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"4","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지난","audio":"/audio/1589c16515823209ca51.mp3"}},{"text":"주에도","meaning":"周，星期","explanation":"주：周，星期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주에도","audio":"/audio/7c32849045b0d44ed948.mp3"}},{"text":"나왔던","meaning":"被刊登，被播放，被记载","explanation":"나오다：被刊登，被播放，被记载；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"4","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나왔던","audio":"/audio/7593dae618cde0584fcf.mp3"}},{"text":"메뉴군요.","meaning":"菜品","explanation":"메뉴：菜品；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"메뉴","audio":"/audio/13b36d6d0ccc7f4960aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57299","senseId":"2","lemma":"메뉴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"메뉴군요","audio":"/audio/590755c39ffa557afda4.mp3"}},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘은","audio":"/audio/45021ad1ec5b4083b856.mp3"}},{"text":"밖에","meaning":"以外，之外","explanation":"밖：以外，之外；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"3","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밖에","audio":"/audio/b49faf879a59fe63a605.mp3"}},{"text":"나가서","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나가서","audio":"/audio/585705317584c3255a86.mp3"}},{"text":"먹을까요?","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹을까요","audio":"/audio/1fa9921ef4932dbe5e37.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7d68e3b7dc1c001c","term":"지나다","zh":"过， 度过","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3","entryId":"82142","definition":"超过某个时期或限度。","pronunciation":["지나다"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"周，星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"46811","definition":"从周一至周日七天为一周期计算的时间单位。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"被刊登，被播放，被记载","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"在书籍、报纸、广播电视等上登载文章、画作或出现某种内容。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"13b36d6d0ccc7f49","term":"메뉴","zh":"菜品","audio":"/audio/13b36d6d0ccc7f4960aa.mp3","entryId":"57299","definition":"料理的种类。","pronunciatio